Dear friends, we finally waited for it! The game came out of the early access, and we are happy to present you the game update

[b]What's new:[/b]
- Diplomacy system, military alliances, requesting help, cooperative research, the ability to attack your enemies yourself;
- Completely rewritten dialogues, different locations in the dialogues;
- Many new solutions, both simple and radical (launching a satellite, alien invasion) 
- Several new laws;
- A new save system with four slots;
- Several new achievements;
- Easter cards describing the world of the game;
- A small encyclopedia on the game.
- And much more.

We have already released two hotfixes for the game, send us information about the bugs and errors, we will try to fix them as soon as possible.

